{'symbol': 'CARR', 'date': '2023-04-17 16:05:00', 'title': 'LINK LOGISTICS AND CARRIER COLLABORATE TO DRIVE VALUE THROUGH ENERGY EFFICIENCY', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINK LOGISTICS (“LINK”), A LEADING NATIONAL LAST-MILE LOGISTICS REAL ESTATE COMPANY DESIGNED TO MEET THE NEEDS OF THE MODERN SUPPLY CHAIN, AND CARRIER GLOBAL CORPORATION (NYSE: CARR), THE LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HEALTHY, SAFE, SUSTAINABLE AND INTELLIGENT BUILDING AND COLD CHAIN SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION TO DELIVER ENERGY MANAGEMENT AND ANALYTICS ACROSS LINK'S ENTERPRISE PORTFOLIO."}